+  precedence CONTENT > ABSENT > REWRITE > METADATA > MATCH. A zero-drift claim
+  requires MATCH, exit 0 — never "sha256 equal" alone; any rc≠0 reading is
+  recorded verbatim and not re-derived by hand.
